= First East River Campaign

Ever since his betrayal in 1922, Chen Jiongming has been a pain in our backside while trying to govern Guangdong. Now, we have a chance to beat him.

We have organized an NRA army to go into East Guangdong to defeat Chen Jiongming's armies. Hopefully this will make us safer.

The outcome is...

- @win: Victory!
- @lose: Defeat.. Wait, what the fuck?!

@win
view-if: nra_strength > 30 and nra_militancy > 0.2
choose-if: nra_strength > 30 and nra_militancy > 0.2

With the help of Soviet equipment and superior military training, Chiang Kai-shek has crushed Chen Jiongming's armies! He is now preparing to flee Guangdong like the coward he is.

@lose
view-if: nra_strength <= 30 and nra_militancy > 0.2
choose-if: nra_strength <= 30 and nra_militancy > 0.2

We have somehow LOST to Chen Jiongming's armies in Eastern Guandong! Seeing how weak the NRA is after the battle, Chen Jiongming marched into Canton and seized the city.

Our party leadership has been arrested, Yunnan and Guangxi have begun fighting and the Soviets cannot reach us anymore. We cannot be saved.

The Guomindang has failed.

- @freeachievementlolol: Congratulations.

